{
  "about": [
    "Demonstration videos shown at the top of exercise pages (Library, then an exercise). Edit this file to swap or remove a video.",
    "Each entry is keyed by the exercise id used in exercises.json and drills.json (also the end of the page address, e.g. #/ex/goblet-squat).",
    "id: the YouTube video id, the 11 characters after v= in a YouTube link (a whole YouTube link pasted here also works).",
    "title and channel: shown on the video poster. length (optional, m:ss): shown on the poster. start (optional): seconds into the video to start from.",
    "embed (optional): set to false for a video whose owner does not allow it to play on other sites; the page then links to it on YouTube instead.",
    "exercise is a label for you and is not shown. Delete an entry to show no video for that exercise.",
    "After editing: run Settings > Content diagnostics, and bump the version in sw.js so installed copies pick up the change."
  ],
